WEBVTT

00:01:58.727 --> 00:02:01.536
My grandparents
lived outside of Waco, Texas,

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.038
in the country.

00:02:03.062 --> 00:02:05.393
And when my grandmother got pregnant,

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:08.380
of course she was not going
to go to the hospital to deliver,

00:02:08.404 --> 00:02:10.565
she was going to have that baby at home.

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:12.017
But when she went into labor,

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:15.883
she called the neighbor woman over
to cook dinner for my grandfather,

00:02:15.907 --> 00:02:17.310
because ...

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:20.729
I mean, it was unthinkable that he
was going to make supper for himself.

00:02:20.753 --> 00:02:22.507
(Laughter)

00:02:22.531 --> 00:02:25.142
Been there.

00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:28.280
(Laughter)

00:02:28.304 --> 00:02:30.876
The neighbor had no experience
with killing a chicken,